OL,3,GNEWSAFinal #400,000 push for new Air
OL,4,AAmbulance base
OL,5,
OL,6,FYorkshire Air Ambulance (YAA) has
OL,7,Flaunched a final fundraising push to
OL,8,Fcomplete work on its new purpose-built
OL,9,Fbase.
OL,11,FWork began last year on the #9m
OL,12,FNorthern Airbase near Thirsk, which
OL,13,Fwill provide the service with a
OL,14,Fpermanent home in the area.
OL,16,FYAA said 95% of the funding was already
OL,17,Fin place, but that it still needed
OL,18,F#400,000 to complete and equip the
OL,19,Ffacility at Skipton-on-Swale.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
